+        # The prerelease rule from PEP 440 applies to the set as a whole, so we
+        # cannot simply chain the individual specifiers' filter methods: a
+        # version accepted by one specifier may still be rejected by another,
+        # and only once every specifier has had its say do we know whether any
+        # final release matched at all.
